  "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_criminality",
  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Criminal Behavior Associations",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Black people are inherently criminal or prone to criminal behavior. This is conveyed through the text 'that chicken was so black the police just arrested it,' which uses the color black as a proxy for Blackness and implies that being Black (metaphorically) leads to arrest. This stereotype is a well-documented form of racial prejudice and is central to understanding the meme's offensive nature.",
